graph LR
    classDef kafka fill:#f3e5f5,stroke:#6a1b9a,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef mem fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#e65100,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef db fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:2px;

    K1[Event: TaskCreated +1]:::kafka --> Batch
    K2[Event: TaskDeleted -1]:::kafka --> Batch
    K3[Event: TaskCreated +1]:::kafka --> Batch
    K4[Event: TaskCreated +1]:::kafka --> Batch
    
    Batch["In-Memory Batch (100 events)"]:::mem --> Fold[Semantic Folder]:::mem
    Fold --> Delta["Net Delta: +2"]:::mem
    
    Delta --> DB[(PostgreSQL)]:::db
    DB -.-> Action[Single SQL Execution:<br/>UPDATE project SET <br/>task_count = task_count + 2]:::db
